| --- | --- | --- |
| 22.1.8 | 22.1.9 | builds |
| 22.2.0 | 22.1.9 | builds |
| 22.1.8 | 22.2.0 | fails |
| 22.2.0 | 22.2.0 | fails |
| 22.2.4 – 22.2.6 | 22.2.4 – 22.2.7 | fails |
| 22.2.7 | 22.2.8 | fails |
| 22.3.0 | 22.3.0 | fails |

